      "writtenOn": "2022-09-15T09:20:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is reusing the `ConnectRequest` from `host.proto`, I think we should not do that and define another message.\n\nAlso I think that this rpc should take a `Connection` instead of an address (you will be able to get back an address from the connection in the server, so you could re create a connection like you are doing)",
