      "message": "nit: `ConnectResponse`\n\nFor the `Rfcomm` prefix, we should try to drop it.\nIf I understand correctly this is entering into conflict with the messages defined in `host.proto` right ?\nWe might want to change the package to `pandora.rfcomm` then to avoid name conflicts",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 11,
        "startChar": 39,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 55
